&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Red Cell Partners is an incubation firm building and investing in rapidly scalable technology-led companies that are bringing revolutionary advancements to market in three distinct practice areas: healthcare, cyber, and national security. United by a shared sense of duty and deep belief in the power of innovation, Red Cell is developing powerful tools and solutions to address our Nation’s most pressing problems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General Submission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t see the right role but believe in our mission-driven approach, have a desire to solve impossible problems, and possess a strong work ethic and entrepreneurial spirit? Please submit your contact information, resume, and/or cover letter to tell us about your job interest and experience and to be considered for a future opening at Red Cell Partners or one of our incubations. Please include your interest type and city in your file name (for example – John Doe_Marketing_Atlanta.doc.).&lt;/p&gt;
