&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Baptist Home Health Care by BAYADA&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for compassionate and dedicated &lt;strong&gt;full time&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Start of Care/ Oasis Admissions Registered Nurse&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Jacksonville, FL&lt;/strong&gt;. This office services our adult and geriatric clients on a &lt;strong&gt;per visit basis&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in territories throughout&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Duval, Baker, Clay and Nassau Counties.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
