&lt;li id=&quot;E311&quot; class=&quot;qowt-li-1_0 qowt-list x-scope qowt-word-para-3&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E312&quot;&gt;Mentorship ability - you enjoy helping others grow and have experience guiding less experienced engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
