&lt;li id=&quot;E339&quot; class=&quot;qowt-li-3_0 qowt-list x-scope qowt-word-para-3&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E340&quot;&gt;Systems thinking - You consider the broader context: scalability, security, observability, and maintainability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
